#: pf2_downloader.py:98
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Usage: PF2Downloader [COMMAND] [PATH]\n"
"Installation utility for Pre-Fortress 2\n"
"Forked from TF2CDownloader\n"
"\n"
"If no arguments are provided, the downloader will be ran in setup mode, in\n"
"which a series of questions will be asked to install the game for a regular\n"
"user. This is what's used when opening the downloader from the desktop.\n"
"\n"
"Valid commands:\n"
"  --install           installs Pre-Fortress 2 into a new folder inside PATH\n"
"  --update            updates the pre-existing Pre-Fortress 2 installation "
"in its\n"
"                      folder inside PATH\n"
"  --help              shows this\n"
"\n"
"PATH is the folder containing Pre-Fortress 2's folder. This is usually the\n"
"sourcemods folder for clients, or the Source dedicated server folder for\n"
"servers.\n"
"\n"
"If PATH isn't provided, then it'll be replaced with the detected path to "
"the\n"
"sourcemods folder in the Steam directory. If it couldn't be detected, then "
"the\n"
"path will be the current work directory."
msgstr ""
"Bruk: PF2Downloader [COMMAND] [PATH]\n"
"Installasjonsverktøy for Pre-Fortress 2.\n"
"\n"
"Hvis ingen argumenter tilbys, vil nedlasteren bli kjørt i oppsettsmodus, "
"der\n"
"en rekke spørsmål vil bli stilt for å installere spillet for en vanlig "
"bruker.\n"
"Det er dette som brukes når nedlasteren startes fra skrivebordet.\n"
"\n"
"Gyldige kommandoer:\n"
"  --install           installerer Pre-Fortress 2 i en ny mappe inne i PATH\n"
"  --update            oppdaterer en allerede eksisterende Pre-Fortress 2-"
"installasjon i egen mappe\n"
"                      inne i PATH\n"
"  --help              viser denne hjelpeteksten\n"
"\n"
"PATH er mappen som inneholder mappen for Pre-Fortress 2. Dette er vanligvis\n"
"sourcemods-mappen for klienter, eller Source-dedikert tjenermappe for "
"tjenere.\n"
"\n"
"Hvis PATH ikke angis, vil den bli erstattet med oppdaget sti til\n"
"sourcemods-mappen i Steam-mappen. Hvis heller ikke den oppdages vil\n"
"sti erstattes med nåværende arbeidsmappe."

